  "details": "I always find it hard to move the camera the way I wanted when flying the camera with only the joysticks. So here's a suggestion that could be helpful (and could be used as extra controller options for the flying camera).\nLeft joystick to move forward, backwards, and side to side.\nRight controller is used to rotate the camera, as in having the right controller as the imaginary flying camera.\nSo, if I tilt my right controller to the left or right, the flying camera will follow that rotation.\nThere also should be a slider to control how smooth the rotation is (like the camera smooth option, but for the rotation when using right controller).\nThere could be many other ways to have a more intuitive control for the flying camera, but this is one option that should be added so it's easier for content creators to get the camera motion they like.",
